  "content": "<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_75db2462-6fbe-4925-9fbd-9d911a2d6b77.png\" width=\"480\" height=\"221\"></strong></p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#ff1900\"><strong>用戶提醒！<span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">Malfu戰鬥動畫將拆分為</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">資源包與資料包專案</span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">以便用戶更輕鬆使用。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#ff1900\"><strong>請點擊下方圖片尋找我的資料包（若未顯示可自行搜尋）：</strong></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/malfu-combat-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#ff1900\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1259338/description_fd55faec-a514-42a2-a29c-112ec0975cc3.png\"></span></strong></span></a></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>本資源包單獨使用將無效，必須搭配資料包。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">建議使用<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">PAXI 或 OPEN LOADER</span>以簡化操作。安裝模組後，請先開啟遊戲再退出以載入設定檔。您應能在config資料夾中找到paxi或openloader資料夾，請將資料包與資源包分別放入對應資料夾。</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>關於動畫</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">已為</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">斧、戰鬥法杖、巨劍、彎刀、爪、匕首、雙刃斧、拳、戟、戰鎚、巨鎚、巨斧、釘頭鎚、細劍與長劍</span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">製作動畫。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">同時也製作了部分</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">姿勢動畫</span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">您可以建立</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">自己的資料包</span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">來使用這些動畫，祝您改裝順利。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">此動畫似乎也能被playerAnimator開發者使用，若您想開發新的戰鬥模組可參考運用。</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>動畫影片</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">來看看吧！</span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DQnLQAKnU9M\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>第二版：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mCPI1qCqSAw?t=1s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>第三版：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6pWg27cdbao\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">我的其他動畫資源包：</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">Malfu簡易動畫（適用於Serious Player Animation模組）：</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/malfu-simple-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1259338/description_1c04cc2f-fb85-4a0c-aa18-90ebda029898.png\" width=\"101\" height=\"101\"></a><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&nbsp;</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">☕️ 若喜歡我的作品，歡迎到<a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmalfu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-Fi</a>支持我。</span></p>",
